				10
			],
			"Message": "style(Wind): Standardize indentation and export formatting\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration files in `Configuration/ESBuild` and `Source/ESBuild.js` to enforce consistent tab-based indentation and compact export statements.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Convert 2-space indentation to tabs across `BaseConfig.js`, `CompileConfig.js`, `TargetConfig.js`, and entry points.\n- Flatten multiline export statements (e.g., `export { posix, sep };`) to match project style conventions.\n- Reorder imports in `Target.js` and `index.js` for logical grouping (config then constants).\n- Ensure `EnvironmentConstant.js` handles multi-line conditionals with consistent indentation.\n\nThese changes align the build configuration layer with the project's strict formatting standards, ensuring deterministic diff outputs and consistent readability across the Wind tooling.",
			"SHA": "69559d42c4aab7ea9d32cafe2a3ad9b0cc044d50"
		},
